        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Sawn timber, hardwood, raw, air dried, u=20%, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Sawn timber, hardwood, raw, air dried, u=20%, at plant
The  volume refers to the wood not including the bark.;
Synonyms: Beech, Buche; 
UUID: af5ccf52-5c50-3b12-896c-5752fd738fcc
Natural drying at the sawmill. Land use is accounted for. Air emissions released from the wood are not accounted for because the same emissions would occur if the wood would not be used.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Naturaly dried on 5 m high staples for 2 years. Shrinkeage for beech
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: see Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: The assumption that the volume change of beech is the same as for other hardwood is considered in the uncertainties.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_af5ccf52-5c50-3b12-896c-5752fd738fcc.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
